    "sub": "The iconic Arecibo telescope is no longer operational. But its legacy lives on. And in 1974, Arecibo sent earthlings' 1st intentional signal to space. The post Humanity’s 1st.",
    "sub_pt": "The iconic Arecibo telescope is no longer operational. But its legacy lives on. And in 1974, Arecibo sent earthlings' 1st intentional signal to space. The post Humanity’s 1st.",
    "sub_en": "The iconic Arecibo telescope is no longer operational. But its legacy lives on. And in 1974, Arecibo sent earthlings' 1st intentional signal to space. The post Humanity’s 1st.",
    "excerpt": "The iconic Arecibo telescope is no longer operational. But its legacy lives on. And in 1974, Arecibo sent earthlings' 1st intentional signal to space. The post Humanity’s 1st intentional signal to space 52 years ago first appeared on.",
